          "content": "If the angles of a trapezoid form an arithmetic sequence and the smallest angle measures $60^{\\circ}$, what is the measure of the largest angle, in degrees?\n\nThink step by step inside <think> </think> tags, then give your final answer inside \\boxed{}."
